keiko 1
# T3, the unusable-autosave half — an autosave that is not a save disables
# Continue instead of falling back to a manual slot, and the bytes are never
# deleted by the read (the take leaves the fixture in place; byte equality is
# the rule test's job).
# Excluded: the rendered Continue reason string (the observation exposes the
# control's disabled state, not the title's reason text).
fixture autosave fixtures/autosave-unreadable.ron
setting play.text_speed 0

expect surface title
expect slot autosave unreadable
expect control title.continue disabled
expect control title.new-game enabled
new-game
expect surface play
expect line "Morning light. A folded letter on the ground, half under a shoe."
